{{Item|Ice Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in {{Zone|jerry's workshop}}.

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Ice Essence}} can be be obtained in {{Zone|jerry's workshop}} and the [[Catacombs]] in multiple ways:
* [[Dungeon Secrets|Dungeon Secret Chests]]
* [[Salvaging#Ice|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Ice Essence}}.
* Trading with {{NPCSprite|Frozen Alex}} visitor in {{Zone|The Garden}}.
* [[Treasure Fishing]] in {{Zone|jerry's workshop}}.
